    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Horizon: Mars is a simplistic, yet strategic Mars colonization simulator, where you make decisions that impact humanities last hope. Set in the distant future, it is up to you to instate a government, promote laws, and manage your colony in Mars. Choose your destiny - do you succeed in turning Mars into a succesful, habitable planet? Do you turn Mars into a technological superpower? That is your choice to make when playing RHM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features include:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ideologies to take lead of your colony</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of decisions to make for the good of Mars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laws you must enact and use to better your planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Statistics such as planet happiness and crime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraform Mars, and turn it into the habitable planet suitable for humanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is in very early stages, so updates will be frequent and you can expect lot's of graphical and gameplay changes to come soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Horizon: Mars is a simplistic, yet strategic Mars colonization simulator, where you make decisions that impact humanities last hope. Set in the distant future, it is up to you to instate a government, promote laws, and manage your colony in Mars. Choose your destiny - do you succeed in turning Mars into a succesful, habitable planet? Do you turn Mars into a technological superpower? That is your choice to make when playing RHM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features include:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ideologies to take lead of your colony</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of decisions to make for the good of Mars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laws you must enact and use to better your planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Statistics such as planet happiness and crime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraform Mars, and turn it into the habitable planet suitable for humanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is in very early stages, so updates will be frequent and you can expect lot's of graphical and gameplay changes to come soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
